class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-305003 dadadali.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8f/Spine_static-305003_dadadali.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"251\" height=\"246\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"251\" data-file-height=\"246\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3050\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%93%92%E5%93%92%E8%BE%BE%E5%88%A9\" title=\"哒哒达利\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%93%92%E5%93%92%E8%BE%BE%E5%88%A9\" title=\"哒哒达利\"><img alt=\"哒哒达利\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305001.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-305001.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305001.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%93%92%E5%93%92%E8%BE%BE%E5%88%A9\" title=\"哒哒达利\">哒哒达利</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.5</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>红土地</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：305002</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“听好了，作为现代马术的项目之一，‘盛装舞步’可没那么简单。我骄傲的先祖就是靠着这样的动作，在战场上躲开了步兵方阵的长矛！而我，会是这个项目最出色的选手！”<br />“没错，速度和力量是很重要，但是‘盛装舞步’考验的是我们的冷静、服从还有自律！其他的马匹大胆热情，善于奔跑，不论是在战场上冲锋，还是在赛场上冲刺，不论是越过战壕还是跨栏，这些都难不倒它们！但只有我——伟大的达利阿拉伯，能够在比赛中保持专注，放松下来，出色地完成‘盛装舞步’！”<br />“缩短跑、伸长跑、肩向内、斜横步、空中换腿——每个动作我都精通！”<br />“呃……你问我怎么突然扬起蹄子？我现在，现在有点兴奋而已。比赛开始时，我就放松下来了，我保证！”</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"305002\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305004.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f5/Belonging-305004.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">花环礼赞<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Circlet of Flowers</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一位小观众所赠予的花环，芬芳的气味令它兴奋异常。<br />据说，它特此垂下头，允许她揉搓三次自己的鬃毛。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305005.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/92/Belonging-305005.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">盛装马鞍<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Splendid Saddle</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />6<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>以上等的貂油擦拭保养，价值不菲的马鞍。<br />由其主人从拍卖行购得，它曾在十年一次的赛马盛会中穿戴出现。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305006.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/fd/Belonging-305006.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">奔向破晓<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Rolling to the Dawn</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />913<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>以五柱轮辐支撑的车轮，表面光滑并定时抛光。<br />由打造冷兵器的工人所作，据说是其跨界的第一次尝试。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A51.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 盛装舞步1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A51.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A51.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A51.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A51.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A51.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A51.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A52.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 盛装舞步2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A52.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A52.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A52.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A52.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A52.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%9B%9B%E8%A3%85%E8%88%9E%E6%AD%A52.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">盛装舞步 <small style=\"color: grey\">Elegant Dance Steps</small></span></span>"}}